ICEWS DATA NOTICE
=================

The files under data/icews/ are derived from the Integrated Crisis Early Warning
System (ICEWS) event data, doi:10.7910/DVN/28075, version 37.0, published by the
Harvard Dataverse.

The ICEWS dataset is made available for research and teaching purposes only.
Redistribution is not permitted. Do not publish, mirror, or commit
data/icews/ (raw or derived parquet) to any public repository or service.

Derived aggregates that do not permit reconstruction of individual records may
be shared subject to the same terms; when in doubt, treat them as restricted.

UNGA votes (doi:10.7910/DVN/7UBUUI) and ideal points (doi:10.7910/DVN/LEJUQZ)
are subject to their Dataverse record terms. Wikidata facts are CC0.
